# Three long boom kicks on the 2-voice kick track: the third steals the first, which must fade out in a few
# milliseconds so the new hit starts at once (device behaviour; hardware found kit blocking new hits).
tempo 120
steps 8
tail 2.0
track kick
param p2 0
note 0 G3 1 127
note 1 G3 1 127
note 2 Gb3 1 127
expect sound 0 8
expect peak_below 0
